{
  "_comment": "Aggregation algorithm test vectors for v1.1. All implementations MUST produce scores within \u00b10.001 of expected_score. Changed in v1.1: step 5 redistributes capped weight to uncapped issuers rather than re-normalizing across all of them; agg-003 was superseded by its own corrected variant and removed; agg-008 was recomputed from unrounded weights.",
